# iPad playtest loop

When the user reports Starhaven gameplay or host bugs from an iPad (especially via the Cursor iOS app), follow `AGENTS.md` and `.cursor/skills/starhaven-ipad-loop/SKILL.md`.

- Gameplay/`src`/`public` changes: commit, push `prateekranka/starhaven` `main`, deploy Cloudflare Pages, tell them to Reload pack or reopen the app.
- Swift/native changes: Linux cannot produce Sqim or TestFlight; commit/push and require `./scripts/ship-ipad.sh` on a Mac.
- Never invent Sqim or TestFlight URLs. Never use Flowdeck.
